build-depends: cygport libabseil-devel libboost-devel libgtest-devel libicu-devel libprotobuf-devel libre2-devel
sdesc: "Google's common Java, C++ and JavaScript library for parsing, formatting, and validating international phone numbers (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "Google's common Java, C++ and JavaScript library for parsing, formatting,
and validating international phone numbers. The Java version is optimized for
running on smartphones, and is used by the Android framework since 4.0 (Ice
Cream Sandwich)."
